        "nl": "From the vertical midpoint of the shape, extend a ray to the right edge of the grid.",
        "code": "def transform(grid):\n    # Find bounding box of non-zero pixels, draw line from center to right\n    import copy\n    out = copy.deepcopy(grid)\n    rows = [r for r in range(len(grid)) if any(grid[r])]\n    cols = [c for c in range(len(grid[0])) if any(grid[r][c] for r in range(len(grid)))]\n    if rows and cols:\n        mid_r = (rows[0] + rows[-1]) // 2\n        max_c = cols[-1]\n        val = grid[mid_r][max_c]\n        for c in range(max_c + 1, len(grid[0])):\n            out[mid_r][c] = val\n    return out\n",
